    Executive: board-trail coverage of opaque-string originating issue ids (Act 18 §5/§7)
    
    parse_originating() dropped non-numeric issue ids, so an originating issue with
    an opaque Antonina id (e.g. ErkrX8EKQJXF6fCQv5fzYl-cannon, Act 22) was invisible
    to the §5/§7 universe. parse_issue() now keeps numeric ids as ints and opaque ids
    as strings, with a deterministic order (numeric ascending, then opaque lexically).
    Adds the Act 22 row to originating.tsv. Hermetic test
    tests/board-trail-opaque-id-smoke.sh. Full suite green.

